win32u: Preserve flush flags when changing the swap interval.

Backport b3c408b3c0b6a308c3f07951960c0d47ea87fece (Wine 11.3).
Updating the interval must not discard PRESENT, UPDATED, FINISHED or
FORCE_SWAP on the same notification. Apply before the context-bind fix.

--- a/dlls/win32u/opengl.c
+++ b/dlls/win32u/opengl.c
@@ -162,7 +162,7 @@
     if (interval != drawable->interval)
     {
         drawable->interval = interval;
-        flags = GL_FLUSH_INTERVAL;
+        flags |= GL_FLUSH_INTERVAL;
     }
 
     if (flags) drawable->funcs->flush( drawable, flags );
